text.en:
Compare against `to_unsigned(7, 3)` (or `"111"`) and reset with `(others => '0')`:
```vhdl
if count = to_unsigned(7, 3) then
    count <= (others => '0');
else
    count <= count + 1;
end if;
```

text.es:
Compara con `to_unsigned(7, 3)` (o `"111"`) y reinicia con `(others => '0')`:
```vhdl
if count = to_unsigned(7, 3) then
    count <= (others => '0');
else
    count <= count + 1;
end if;
```
